{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>Your glory.</b> Like \"yourself,\" for thus it is written: בעבור כבודי (Exodus 22:23 [?])."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 33, :notes {0 "The citation פ' כב likely refers to Exodus 22, but the phrase בעבור כבודי does not appear in Exodus 22; the reference may be to Exodus 33:19 itself or another passage, and the chapter number may be corrupt or abbreviated differently."}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:40:06.089466875Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}